        <wp:meta_value>Yes. Choose certified translation and tell us that the document is for USCIS when we follow up. Foreign-language documents generally require a full English translation with a certification of accuracy, completeness and the translator’s competence. We’ll confirm the certification included in your quote. USCIS decides acceptance; no application outcome is guaranteed.</wp:meta_value>
